msgid ""
"By using different spectral bands in the different colour channels (RGB) of "
"an image, certain\n"
"features can be emphasised in the data.\n"
"\n"
"Popular RGB composites are True Colour (red, blue and green\n"
"bands) or False Colour (near-infrared, red and green bands).\n"
"\n"
"More info [here](${ link1 }) or [here](${ link2 })."
msgstr ""
"Door verschillende spectrale banden te gebruiken in de verschillende "
"kleurkanalen (RGB) van een beeld, kunnen bepaalde\n"
"kenmerken in de data worden benadrukt.\n"
"\n"
"Populaire RGB-composieten zijn Ware kleuren (rode, blauwe en groene\n"
"banden) of Valse kleuren (nabij-infrarode, rode en groene banden).\n"
"\n"
"Meer info [hier](${ link1 }) of [hier](${ link2 })."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Create a simple band ratio (A/B) to highlight the spectral differences "
"between two bands,\n"
"or create a normalized difference index ((A-B)/(A+B)) to compare your data "
"across time.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Popular difference indices are the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index "
"(NDVI),\n"
"which uses the near-infrared and red bands or the Normalized Difference "
"Water Index (NDWI),\n"
"which uses the near-infrared and shortwave infrared bands.\n"
"\n"
"More info [here](${ link1 }) or [here](${ link2 })."
msgstr ""
"Maak een eenvoudige bandverhouding (A/B) om de spectrale verschillen tussen "
"twee banden te benadrukken,\n"
"of maak een genormaliseerde verschilindex ((A-B)/(A+B)) om jouw data over "
"de tijd te vergelijken.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Populaire verschilindices zijn de Normalized Difference Vegetation Index "
"(NDVI),\n"
"die de nabij-infrarode en rode banden gebruikt, of de Normalized Difference "
"Water Index (NDWI),\n"
"die de nabij-infrarode en kortgolvig infrarode banden gebruikt.\n"
"\n"
"Meer info [hier](${ link1 }) of [hier](${ link2 })."

