msgid "VHR Europe 2021"
msgstr "VHR Europe 2021"

msgid ""
"This dataset comprises one cloud-free Very High Resolution optical coverage "
"of 39 European States (EEA-39) including all islands of those countries "
"plus \n"
"the French Overseas Departments of French Guiana, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte and Réunion but excluding French Overseas Territories. The area of \n"
"interest (~6 million square kilometres) is extended by a 4 km buffer over "
"the sea and a 500 m buffer over countries bordering the EEA-39 states. \n"
"More info "
"[here](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/VHR-IMAGE-2021)."
msgstr ""
"Deze dataset bestaat uit één wolkenvrije optische dekking met zeer hoge "
"resolutie van 39 Europese staten (EEA-39), inclusief alle eilanden van die "
"landen, plus \n"
"de Franse overzeese departementen Frans-Guyana, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte en Réunion, maar exclusief de Franse overzeese gebiedsdelen. Het \n"
"interessegebied (~6 miljoen vierkante kilometer) is uitgebreid met een "
"buffer van 4 km boven zee en een buffer van 500 m over landen die grenzen "
"aan de EEA-39-staten. \n"
"Meer info "
"[hier](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/VHR-IMAGE-2021)."

