msgid ""
"Dry Matter Productivity is defined as the overall growth rate, or dry "
"biomass increase, of the vegetation. It is expressed in kg of Dry Matter "
"per hectare and per day (kg DM/ha/day)."
msgstr ""
"Dry Matter Productivity is gedefinieerd als de algehele groeisnelheid, of "
"toename van droge biomassa, van de vegetatie. Het wordt uitgedrukt in kg "
"droge stof per hectare per dag (kg DM/ha/dag)."

msgid ""
"GPP is defined as the total amount of carbon compounds produced by "
"photosynthesis of plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time, "
"expressed in gC/m²/day."
msgstr ""
"GPP is gedefinieerd als de totale hoeveelheid koolstofverbindingen die in "
"een bepaalde periode door fotosynthese van planten in een ecosysteem wordt "
"geproduceerd, uitgedrukt in gC/m²/dag."

msgid ""
"NPP is defined as the net amount of biomass, or carbon, produced by plants "
"per unit area and time, expressed in gC/m²/day."
msgstr ""
"NPP is gedefinieerd als de netto hoeveelheid biomassa, of koolstof, die "
"planten per oppervlakte-eenheid en tijd produceren, uitgedrukt in gC/m²/dag."

msgid ""
"GDMP represents the total amount of dry matter produced by land plants per "
"unit time through photosynthesis. It is expressed in kg of Dry Matter per "
"hectare and per day (kg DM/ha/day)."
msgstr ""
"GDMP vertegenwoordigt de totale hoeveelheid droge stof die landplanten per "
"tijdseenheid via fotosynthese produceren. Het wordt uitgedrukt in kg droge "
"stof per hectare per dag (kg DM/ha/dag)."

